cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "AgriFusionR: An Integration Framework for Agricultural Analytics"
abstract: >
  Assembles agricultural analyses around the management unit within a season,
  aggregating covariates over phenological windows derived from accumulated
  growing degree days rather than calendar months, validating with spatial
  resampling, and reporting distribution-free prediction intervals.
